WEBVTT

00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:18.875
"Policies Changing Repeatedly!"
"Who is Responsible?!"

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:20.125
"Episode 5 - Broadcasting Cancelled?!"

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:21.083
"A new shock for fans of the original work!"

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:24.958
"A new shock for fans of the original work!"
"Their willingness to try is getting them nowhere!"

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.958
"Written Oath"

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:28.625
"I hereby give permission
to make the Excel Saga anime

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:32.375
into a drama
about social problems."

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.083
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:48.500
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.333
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:00:52.333 --> 00:01:00.292
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:04.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:08.125
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:15.875
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:20.708
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:24.708
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:28.667
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.875
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:34.125
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:36.042
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:36.042 --> 00:01:37.750
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.875
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:44.542
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:01:44.542 --> 00:01:47.750
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.292
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:01:52.292 --> 00:02:00.125
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:08.583
"Morning Paper Editing Department"

00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:13.083
Why?!

00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:16.083
Why can't you
print this photograph?!

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.417
It's an incident that has to
do with the corruption of the city!

00:02:18.417 --> 00:02:19.500
You idiot!

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.167
This'll be no different than a
third-rate fabricated photograph!

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:24.958
Then if I can corroborate
this, you'll run it?!

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.375
Who these guys met
with and who they talked to--

00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:29.792
You greenhorn,
enough with your big talk.

00:02:29.792 --> 00:02:32.708
Listen to me.
This is too big and too deep.

00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:35.125
If a brat like
you sticks his nose in...

00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:39.125
You're saying I'll get whacked?
Just like Masa, the ace reporter?

00:02:43.917 --> 00:02:45.500
Miyo, tea!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.375
Okay!

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.125
Hey, that was fast, Miyo.

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.125
Yes, because I was
waiting for you to call!

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:52.625
You're a twenty-year
veteran all right.

00:02:52.625 --> 00:02:54.958
Oh, Miyo's practically a granny!

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:03.750
Masa...

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.458
--Miyo, this tea is lukewarm.

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:06.167
--Damn those big evil bastards!
--Miyo, this tea is lukewarm.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:08.542
--Damn those big evil bastards!
--Oh, that's toilet cleaner.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.958
Hail Ilpalazzo!

00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:16.500
Lord Ilpalazzo, how are you?!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.917
I'm good!

00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:19.667
I lead a life of eating and not eating,

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:21.667
there are explosions
mixed in with my activities,

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:22.833
and if I make one mistake,
it means death!

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:23.500
"Death"

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.917
That's what every day is like,

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:29.542
but these days, I've become
completely used to that feeling!

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:33.792
I will pitch with all my might
to Lord Ilpalazzo without reserve!

00:03:35.167 --> 00:03:38.208
I do not really understand,
but it is good that you are energetic.

00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:39.417
Yes, of course!

00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:42.000
If it's just being energetic,
it doesn't even cost a thing!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.333
How promising.

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:45.875
It will serve
today's critical mission well.

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:48.167
It is a critical mission?

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:49.500
Precisely.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.250
It is possible that our ACROSS's
plan to conquer the city

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.125
has been perceived
by the present authorities.

00:03:55.125 --> 00:03:56.667
Oh, my god! What a crisis!

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:56.875
--Oh, what a crisis! That's a crisis!

00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:59.042
--On what basis do you say this?
--Oh, what a crisis! That's a crisis!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.917
This has been circulating.

00:04:01.917 --> 00:04:03.667
"Searching!"

00:04:04.417 --> 00:04:05.792
Th-That is...

00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:08.042
Is this your doing?

00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:09.208
Excuse me...

00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:11.375
We came because we
saw the flyer.

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:13.750
I'm Mikako Hyatt.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.875
And I'm Excel Kobayashi!

00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:17.333
We are the...

00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:19.417
Um, hello?! Um, uh, um...

00:04:19.417 --> 00:04:20.833
Excel...

00:04:21.292 --> 00:04:24.000
How do you intend
to take responsibility

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.500
for the maintenance
of ACROSS's secrecy?

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.208
Please forgive me, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:04:29.208 --> 00:04:31.917
I, Excel, was lacking in prudence!

00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:34.708
I'd like to fall into a hole right now!

00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:36.208
Then fall.

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:39.833
Fans of the original work,
we are sorry to have kept you waiting!

00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:42.583
The pit has made its first
appearance in episode five!

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:44.833
Oh, but it's so deep!
And dark! And scary!

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:46.625
Even as I am haunted
by my sense of guilt,

00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:49.083
I cannot suppress the sense
of terror that wells up in my heart!

00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:50.125
Or rather, isn't this a
little too deep?! Was this hole...

00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:54.417
Now, for today's mission,
you will need to infiltrate City Hall.

00:04:54.417 --> 00:04:55.875
City Hall?

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:56.958
Exactly.

00:04:56.958 --> 00:05:01.000
We will confuse the political
situation, before they act.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.083
Find out the weaknesses
of the top-ranking officials

00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:05.792
and if possible, I would like
you to force them into resigning.

00:05:05.792 --> 00:05:08.583
Offense is the best defense, is it not?

00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:10.375
I look forward to your success.

00:05:10.375 --> 00:05:12.917
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:16.000
"City Hall"

00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:17.167
"Lavatory"
"Staff Only Lavatory"

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.625
All right!

00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:26.792
I see! The scenes from last time

00:05:26.792 --> 00:05:30.125
must have been a grand
foreshadowing for this!

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:32.042
Among all the girls
in the world of pretty girls,

00:05:32.042 --> 00:05:35.125
I must be the most suited to
cleaning toilets, right, Lord Ilpalazzo?

00:05:35.125 --> 00:05:37.167
Hey, what am I elated for?!

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:39.250
My real goal here is to
collect data from this establishment,

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.875
as well as to scout things out!

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.833
I have no time to be
feeling a little excited over

00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:45.792
the urinals that I'm
seeing for the first time ever!

00:05:45.792 --> 00:05:47.542
I must go on to
my espionage activities,

00:05:47.542 --> 00:05:50.417
for the realization of
the ideals of our ACROSS!

00:05:50.417 --> 00:05:53.292
Well, I had no idea
that you were here, Sir.

00:05:53.292 --> 00:05:54.708
Uh oh.

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:57.875
I had a little business to do.

00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:01.708
Oh, I see. By the way, Sir...

00:06:01.708 --> 00:06:05.875
Now that I think about it,
there was no real need to hide.

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:09.125
Well, that is regarding
that certain affair...

00:06:09.125 --> 00:06:11.333
Has some kind
of problem developed?

00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:13.417
No, no, everything is
going smoothly.

00:06:13.417 --> 00:06:16.500
There was a little trouble
with the contractors, but that's all.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.500
I hope you can take care of
problems like that on your own.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.833
Or else, you won't be
able to fill the position of Mayor.

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:23.792
What?!

00:06:23.792 --> 00:06:25.333
Me?! Mayor?!

00:06:25.333 --> 00:06:27.833
The current Mayor is incompetent.

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:31.167
The Deputy Mayor
has problems with women.

00:06:31.167 --> 00:06:35.167
Considering the future of the city,
I think we need new talent.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.667
And you seem to be
popular with those below you.

00:06:39.667 --> 00:06:41.042
Thank you so much!

00:06:41.042 --> 00:06:43.375
With your permission,
I will exert myself to the utmost!

00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:45.708
I will serve you, Sir!

00:06:46.542 --> 00:06:50.792
"Before you grasp someone
else's hand, wash your hands."

00:06:53.042 --> 00:06:56.792
109
fumisorisupirepakanishiteraki?

00:06:56.792 --> 00:06:59.792
You shouldn't scribble on
the toilet stalls.

00:07:08.542 --> 00:07:11.917
"City Hall"
All right, guess I'll go.

00:07:11.958 --> 00:07:13.042
"Reception Desk"

00:07:13.042 --> 00:07:14.542
E-Excuse me...

00:07:14.542 --> 00:07:16.958
Welcome. Join me for some fries?

00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:18.042
No, I mean...

00:07:18.042 --> 00:07:21.042
Would anyone like
something to drink?

00:07:21.042 --> 00:07:22.375
Give me one over here!

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:23.875
Yes, Sir.

00:07:27.542 --> 00:07:29.125
It's good that
I've gotten out of there,

00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:32.000
but where can I go to obtain the
weakness of high-ranking people?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.250
I have absolutely
no idea where to start.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.417
And I've got so much
enthusiasm, but nothing else!

00:07:36.417 --> 00:07:38.625
Lord Ilpalazzo,
Excel will not lose hope!

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:40.333
<i>No matter how many days it takes,</i>

00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:41.958
<i>I will search this</i>
<i>place through and through!</i>

00:07:41.958 --> 00:07:44.958
<i>Uh oh! Second time today!</i>

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.208
That was a close call.

00:07:52.208 --> 00:07:54.958
But this place is
so hot and crowded.

00:07:57.417 --> 00:07:59.417
What could that be?

00:07:59.917 --> 00:08:02.958
It seems to be a PC.

00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:05.250
A suspicious PC
in such a suspicious room.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.667
This is too suspicious.

00:08:06.667 --> 00:08:09.458
However, PCs are the key
to our society of information.

00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:11.792
I may be able to handily obtain
information that will be useful

00:08:11.792 --> 00:08:14.583
to my life and to our conquest.

00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:17.833
Oh?

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.417
"Top Secret"

00:08:19.417 --> 00:08:21.792
This is too suspicious.

00:08:23.167 --> 00:08:25.792
"Please enter a password.
If you make a mistake, a laser will be fired."

00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:30.292
Oh, come to think of it!

00:08:30.292 --> 00:08:32.125
Oh, not that...

00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:34.458
"fumisorisupirepakanishiteraki"
This, this. This must be it.

00:08:34.458 --> 00:08:36.792
I don't have time
to be dead like that.

00:08:36.792 --> 00:08:38.000
"Please enter a password. If you make a mistake,
a laser will be fired." "fumisorisupirepakanishiteraki"

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.667
"Password acknowledgement... OK"

00:08:39.792 --> 00:08:42.250
Thank you,
scribbles in the toilet stalls!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.833
"Break Room"

00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:47.333
I'll leave her,
so wait for me a while longer.

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.625
Oh, that's what you always say.

00:08:49.625 --> 00:08:53.000
I'm serious this time, so...

00:08:54.458 --> 00:08:56.333
--Oh, Sir! I'm sorry you had to see

00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:58.625
--Oh, it's so chilly!
--that terrible sight!

00:08:58.625 --> 00:09:01.125
I don't mind if you continue.

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.083
After all, they do say,
"All great men like women."

00:09:04.083 --> 00:09:07.333
You probably could not lead
the city without such qualities.

00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:08.917
Sir, you don't mean...

00:09:08.917 --> 00:09:12.000
I will be supporting you
in the next mayoral election.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.167
Th-Thank you so much!

00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:17.250
But in return, allocate some
budget for that one thing.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.167
Why yes, of course!

00:09:24.708 --> 00:09:25.833
What? What?

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:28.917
Let's see. Illegal access
outside designated times?

00:09:28.917 --> 00:09:31.208
Oh no!

00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:36.875
Oh? What could this be?

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.875
Really!

00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:43.292
Who would have thought the
fumisorisupirepakanishiteraki would leak?

00:09:43.292 --> 00:09:47.125
That's why I suggested instead
of fumisorisupirepakanishiteraki...

00:09:47.125 --> 00:09:48.542
We can talk about that later!

00:09:48.542 --> 00:09:51.708
In any case, we have to stop
them now before they can leak the info.

00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:53.750
This is the last place left.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.542
Could it be that if I released this,

00:09:55.542 --> 00:09:58.042
it'll cause a big commotion?!

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:00.875
Lord Ilpalazzo, Excel has done it!

00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:02.667
What are you doing there?!

00:10:02.667 --> 00:10:05.375
Give it up, you have no means of escape!

00:10:06.042 --> 00:10:07.875
This is in the way.

00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:10.458
Section Chief,
please leave this up to me.

00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:12.083
Ah, do that, will you?

00:10:12.083 --> 00:10:15.333
This is pretty bad.
Since it's come to this...

00:10:15.333 --> 00:10:17.333
Don't do it!

00:10:20.417 --> 00:10:22.375
Hey, you! Hang in there!

00:10:22.375 --> 00:10:24.583
That was very close!

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.750
Why?

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.125
Why are you here?

00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:34.625
Why are you bastards here?!

00:10:34.625 --> 00:10:37.417
Oh, you're here too.
Looking forward to working with you.

00:10:37.417 --> 00:10:39.250
I don't want to look
forward to working with you!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.250
You guys change occupations right now!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.750
If you don't, I'll make you cry!
Or else, I'll cry!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:47.333
What a selfish thing to say.
You could change occupations then.

00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:51.833
There's a reason why
I have to become a civil servant.

00:10:51.833 --> 00:10:53.958
W-Well...

00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:57.125
I-I can't say it!
There's no way I can say it!

00:11:15.083 --> 00:11:16.583
My, my.

00:11:18.417 --> 00:11:21.500
My name is Kabapu.
I am your supervisor.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.542
It has been decided that
all of you will be assigned to

00:11:23.542 --> 00:11:26.167
the Department of
City Environment Security.

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:26.625
--You will receive documents

00:11:26.625 --> 00:11:28.125
<i>--What's with this guy?</i>
--at the receptionist's desk.

00:11:28.125 --> 00:11:29.958
--You are to immediately familiarize
yourself with their contents.

00:11:29.958 --> 00:11:31.958
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:34.458
That is all. Dismissed.

00:11:39.333 --> 00:11:41.000
It was nothing.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.750
It was nothing!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.875
I told you that it was nothing!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.292
Hey, how is it?

00:12:02.292 --> 00:12:03.458
No good.

00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:04.833
Please keep looking!

00:12:04.833 --> 00:12:06.333
Yes, Sir!

00:12:08.042 --> 00:12:10.000
They're so persistent!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.917
And I can't go back
there anymore either!

00:12:12.917 --> 00:12:15.292
"Break Room"

00:12:18.292 --> 00:12:21.042
I've already had it up
to here with the apartment!

00:12:21.042 --> 00:12:24.833
Why do I gotta hang out
with you guys at work too?!

00:12:24.833 --> 00:12:25.792
"It's fate..."

00:12:25.792 --> 00:12:28.250
You know, we're probably
tied to each other

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.958
with the red string of fate.

00:12:29.958 --> 00:12:32.958
Don't say creepy things like that!
Besides, that red string is for...

00:12:32.958 --> 00:12:35.208
Oh, Mr. Watanabe.

00:12:35.958 --> 00:12:38.375
Do you work here?

00:12:38.375 --> 00:12:41.042
W-Well, I just started
working here today,

00:12:41.042 --> 00:12:42.958
but in a different department.

00:12:42.958 --> 00:12:44.708
What about you?

00:12:44.708 --> 00:12:46.875
I am working part-time.

00:12:46.875 --> 00:12:51.042
I see. Must be tough.

00:12:51.833 --> 00:12:53.042
Here you go.

00:12:53.042 --> 00:12:54.250
This is on me.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.708
Good luck to both of us in our jobs.

00:12:56.708 --> 00:12:58.208
Good-bye.

00:13:00.792 --> 00:13:01.917
Red string...

00:13:01.917 --> 00:13:03.375
"It's green."

00:13:03.375 --> 00:13:05.958
Don't cheapen it!

00:13:05.958 --> 00:13:07.958
You romantic comedy boy!

00:13:07.958 --> 00:13:10.208
Shut up! I'm gonna hit you!

00:13:10.417 --> 00:13:14.042
Did you hear? I am the Mayor.
I will be Mayor soon!

00:13:14.042 --> 00:13:16.750
Then I'll climb the ranks from
being a Deputy Mayor's mistress

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.000
to being a Mayor's mistress.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.083
That's right. The city exists
just for the two of us.

00:13:22.083 --> 00:13:24.625
W-W-W-Who the hell are you?!

00:13:24.625 --> 00:13:27.583
I serve Lord Ilpalazzo, <i>führe</i>r
of the secret society of ACROSS,

00:13:27.583 --> 00:13:31.875
which is striving to
conquer the city. I am Excel!

00:13:31.875 --> 00:13:35.000
Oh, I am such an honest person,
I answered the question in full.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.250
ACROSS?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.375
Excel?

00:13:37.375 --> 00:13:39.708
Deputy Mayor! You have been
entrusted with governing the city!

00:13:39.708 --> 00:13:41.292
How immoral can
you be to have an affair?!

00:13:41.292 --> 00:13:43.167
Be responsible and
resign from your office!

00:13:43.167 --> 00:13:45.875
Or else, I will publicize the
truth to the world

00:13:45.875 --> 00:13:48.000
and force you to resign!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.125
Oh, Lord Ilpalazzo,

00:13:49.125 --> 00:13:51.500
Excel is only a step away
from completing the mission!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.500
Resign?!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.208
The Mayor's office is
right there in front of me!

00:13:54.208 --> 00:13:55.708
I can't resign now!

00:13:55.708 --> 00:13:57.083
You are such a poor sport!

00:13:57.083 --> 00:13:59.042
Your persistence must
make you a Type O Cancer!

00:13:59.042 --> 00:14:01.250
No, there is another
way to resolve this.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.625
You are the
one and only witness.

00:14:02.625 --> 00:14:05.667
That means, if I get rid of you,
it'll all end happily ever after.

00:14:05.667 --> 00:14:07.875
Th-That's a little...

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:10.958
Perhaps a more peaceful method
of resolution would be better?

00:14:10.958 --> 00:14:12.958
Who's in favor of
getting rid of the witness?

00:14:12.958 --> 00:14:13.583
--Me!

00:14:13.583 --> 00:14:14.542
--Who's against it?
--Me!

00:14:14.542 --> 00:14:15.333
Me!

00:14:15.333 --> 00:14:17.542
Liquidation has been passed, two to one.

00:14:17.542 --> 00:14:21.333
We will put it into effect immediately.

00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:22.417
Do not run!

00:14:22.417 --> 00:14:25.042
It is a citizen's duty to
obey a democratic decision!

00:14:25.042 --> 00:14:28.500
I haven't registered and
I've never paid municipal tax,

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.000
so I'm not a citizen!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.375
All the more reason to kill you!

00:14:33.667 --> 00:14:37.125
I pushed it a little despite myself
because I was talking to young people.

00:14:37.125 --> 00:14:38.792
Please do not push yourself too hard.

00:14:38.792 --> 00:14:40.458
If something were to happen to you, Sir,

00:14:40.458 --> 00:14:43.292
"Mayor!"
it would be a devastating blow for this city.

00:14:43.292 --> 00:14:44.667
I know.

00:14:44.667 --> 00:14:46.833
I can finally start the
Department of Security,

00:14:46.833 --> 00:14:48.500
which I have dreamed
of doing for years.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.500
I must not act recklessly.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.458
Congratulations, Sir.

00:14:52.458 --> 00:14:53.750
Thank you.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:57.083
So, your great ambition
is finally going to blossom.

00:14:57.083 --> 00:14:58.292
And on that note...

00:14:58.292 --> 00:15:01.583
Money, again?
You certainly never get tired of it.

00:15:01.583 --> 00:15:02.583
--Where did she go?!

00:15:02.583 --> 00:15:05.000
--Pay your taxes!
--Where did she go?!

00:15:05.875 --> 00:15:09.083
This place is really
starting to grow on me.

00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:10.875
No, no, I must not give up hope now!

00:15:10.875 --> 00:15:14.833
Bathroom stall scribbles,
please show me the path I must follow!

00:15:14.833 --> 00:15:19.917
I have learned too much. I will be killed.
It's too late, I can't escape.

00:15:19.917 --> 00:15:22.125
Let's see...

00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:25.375
Oh, I'm coming out.

00:15:29.208 --> 00:15:30.542
Wha?! Wha?!

00:15:30.542 --> 00:15:32.875
I just cleaned this place!

00:15:32.875 --> 00:15:36.417
I don't have time to be saying
things like that! This is bad!

00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:40.542
"Copy Room"

00:15:40.542 --> 00:15:41.250
--There she is!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.917
--Stop right there!
--There she is!

00:15:50.708 --> 00:15:53.000
A PC in a place like this?

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:56.042
There may be
information in such a thing.

00:16:01.375 --> 00:16:03.750
I do not really
understand this after all.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:06.167
I shall ask Senior Excel for advice.

00:16:06.167 --> 00:16:08.500
"Pet"
"Sending Mail?"

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.500
It is so tight in here.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.167
I'm running!

00:16:12.167 --> 00:16:13.708
We're chasing!

00:16:13.708 --> 00:16:15.083
"Maicho Newspaper"

00:16:15.083 --> 00:16:16.333
"Morning Paper Editing Department"

00:16:19.375 --> 00:16:20.708
Masa...

00:16:22.958 --> 00:16:26.792
What the heck?
Another anonymous e-mail?

00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:28.708
This is...

00:16:28.708 --> 00:16:30.500
"List of Illegal Routing from Budget
for Redevelopment of the West Gate"

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.958
This is amazing!

00:16:31.958 --> 00:16:35.125
And if we analyze the header,
we can get its origins too!

00:16:35.125 --> 00:16:37.625
That can wait until later.

00:16:37.625 --> 00:16:39.333
This goes on the front page
of tomorrow's paper!

00:16:39.333 --> 00:16:41.292
Hey! Get everyone over here!

00:16:41.292 --> 00:16:42.292
Yes, Sir!

00:16:42.292 --> 00:16:43.625
Chief Editor...

00:16:43.625 --> 00:16:46.000
This is revenge for ace reporter Masa.

00:16:46.625 --> 00:16:47.667
Yes, Sir!

00:16:47.667 --> 00:16:49.958
Where in the world could this place be?!

00:16:50.833 --> 00:16:52.500
Senior Excel!

00:16:55.292 --> 00:16:57.667
You know, I hate to say this,

00:16:57.667 --> 00:16:59.750
but the people under
you are so incompetent.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.125
The Deputy Mayor
and the Development Chief?

00:17:02.125 --> 00:17:05.083
You should drop the
men that need to be dropped.

00:17:05.083 --> 00:17:08.667
After all, I intend that you keep
working for a long time to come.

00:17:08.667 --> 00:17:10.000
Thank you very much.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.167
But in return, you know
what you need to do, right?

00:17:12.167 --> 00:17:15.125
Yes, the Department of Security
will have the city's complete...

00:17:15.125 --> 00:17:17.583
W-Who are you?!

00:17:18.833 --> 00:17:20.833
S-She heard us.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.833
"Kill - Kill"

00:17:25.833 --> 00:17:28.208
"Kill Right Away Department"

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:31.833
I feel sorry for you, but since you
heard us, I cannot let you go.

00:17:31.833 --> 00:17:34.208
You'll have to be sacrificed
for the peace of the city.

00:17:34.208 --> 00:17:35.500
What?!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.917
What a threatening statement
for an administrator!

00:17:40.833 --> 00:17:43.042
What are you people doing?!

00:17:44.458 --> 00:17:46.000
Oh, Sir!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.458
Sir, she saw me in the act!

00:17:48.458 --> 00:17:51.708
She was hacking
the list of rerouted funds!

00:17:51.708 --> 00:17:53.958
In the act?! Hacking?

00:17:53.958 --> 00:17:55.167
Sir, what is this about?

00:17:55.167 --> 00:17:56.750
I will take care of her immediately!

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.167
So, Sir, in the next
mayoral election, please...

00:17:59.167 --> 00:18:02.417
Mr. Deputy Mayor,
what are you saying?! He supports me.

00:18:02.417 --> 00:18:05.167
Sir, what is the meaning of this?!

00:18:05.167 --> 00:18:08.167
Oh, well. There are plenty of
replacements available.

00:18:10.042 --> 00:18:11.375
Ow!

00:18:13.833 --> 00:18:15.917
Yamazaki?! It's you, isn't it, Yamazaki?!

00:18:15.917 --> 00:18:19.042
Hitman, kill that woman!
Kill the rest as well!

00:18:19.042 --> 00:18:19.708
No way!

00:18:19.708 --> 00:18:21.875
--Mr. Mayor, how could you do this?!
--You monster! What are you thinking?!

00:18:21.875 --> 00:18:25.500
Shut up! You guys approached
him behind my back too!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.000
Hitman, hurry up and kill them! Hitman!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.542
Kill them. All of them.

00:18:33.125 --> 00:18:33.875
--Stop this! Do you even...

00:18:33.875 --> 00:18:37.417
Yamazaki, we sang together at
the spring party, remember? Spare me!

00:18:37.417 --> 00:18:39.417
--A dream?! Is this a dream?!
--I don't want to die!

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:43.917
Without ceremony,
dear Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:18:43.917 --> 00:18:45.792
The corruption in this government

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:48.500
was far beyond
what we had imagined, so...

00:18:53.542 --> 00:18:54.958
I'm in a pinch!

00:18:54.958 --> 00:18:56.750
Oh, what's that?!

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.250
Now's my chance!

00:18:58.958 --> 00:19:00.958
He is too fast!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:06.042
Stop it!

00:19:06.042 --> 00:19:08.833
How dare you! I will pay
you back for this someday!

00:19:08.833 --> 00:19:09.708
What?

00:19:09.708 --> 00:19:11.125
Don't you forget this!

00:19:11.125 --> 00:19:12.625
Hey, hey.

00:19:13.917 --> 00:19:15.458
Farewell!

00:19:27.958 --> 00:19:29.417
<i>Masa...</i>

00:19:29.875 --> 00:19:31.458
That idiot!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.500
What the?!

00:19:36.292 --> 00:19:37.792
Sh-She's dead!

00:19:37.792 --> 00:19:39.625
I-Is it murder?!

00:19:39.625 --> 00:19:40.792
Could it be that you did it?

00:19:40.792 --> 00:19:42.292
N-No!

00:19:45.875 --> 00:19:47.625
This is a scoop!

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:49.625
I am innocent!
I have been falsely accused!

00:19:50.458 --> 00:19:52.750
Oh, I thought we were dead.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:57.375
My, my, this is
just not funny anymore.

00:19:57.375 --> 00:20:01.625
In the end, animation
must show love and peace.

00:20:01.625 --> 00:20:05.833
So let us briskly
bring them back to life.

00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:07.958
Love and peace.

00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:10.875
Love and peace.

00:20:15.083 --> 00:20:17.750
Love and peace!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:20.875
"Mr. Pe From Last Time"

00:20:20.875 --> 00:20:25.208
Wow, thank you, Papa!
I always wanted one of these!

00:20:25.208 --> 00:20:27.958
Oh, you spoil him so much, Dear!

00:20:28.917 --> 00:20:31.750
I'll buy you anything that you want.

00:20:32.625 --> 00:20:34.667
I want a kid brother!

00:20:34.667 --> 00:20:38.667
All right, Dad will work hard at it!
Right, Dear?

00:20:38.667 --> 00:20:40.208
Oh, you!

00:20:41.792 --> 00:20:42.750
What's wrong?!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:43.708
Mama!

00:20:43.708 --> 00:20:45.667
You aren't...

00:20:45.667 --> 00:20:47.458
It looks like it.

00:20:47.458 --> 00:20:50.333
Why?! The numbers don't add up!

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:53.167
Even when she was with me,
my wife and Gomez were...

00:20:53.167 --> 00:20:54.833
No!

00:20:57.542 --> 00:20:58.958
Hello.

00:21:01.125 --> 00:21:02.625
You!

00:21:03.667 --> 00:21:05.750
Can you see me?!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.000
There's something I want
you to tell my wife and son!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.667
No! He does not understand me!

00:21:14.667 --> 00:21:17.042
The city is truly at
the height of corruption.

00:21:17.042 --> 00:21:19.750
We, ACROSS, must take the
reins of power as soon as possible.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.917
Hey...

00:21:20.917 --> 00:21:23.750
We came because we saw
the flier looking for band applicants.

00:21:24.583 --> 00:21:26.250
Not again.

00:21:27.708 --> 00:21:29.625
That's right. It's very urgent.

00:21:29.625 --> 00:21:32.333
I'm counting on you, Shioji.

00:21:33.208 --> 00:21:35.792
Now, please fill the duties for
Mayor, Deputy Mayor,

00:21:35.792 --> 00:21:39.583
and Development Chief,
respectively.

00:21:39.583 --> 00:21:41.875
This has saved me a lot of trouble.

00:21:41.875 --> 00:21:44.208
I will protect this city!

00:21:45.042 --> 00:21:49.917
"Episode 5: The Interesting Giant Tower"

00:21:49.917 --> 00:21:51.750
"Episode 5: The Interesting Giant Tower"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:53.750
"Episode 5: The Interesting Giant Tower"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:21:54.292 --> 00:21:56.958
♪ I'm Nabeshin. The afro suits me. ♪

00:21:56.958 --> 00:21:59.750
♪ Maintenance is easy.
Just wash it once. ♪

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.792
♪ It's fluffy on my head.
Women fall like flies ♪

00:22:02.792 --> 00:22:05.625
♪ and all men turn
around to take a second look. ♪

00:22:05.625 --> 00:22:11.417
♪ Shaggy and curly and frizzy and messy.
The afro is the best. ♪

00:22:11.417 --> 00:22:17.958
♪ Shaggy and curly and frizzy and messy. ♪

00:22:17.958 --> 00:22:20.333
"Today's Nabeshin... On Vacation"

00:22:20.333 --> 00:22:23.125
♪ I'm Nabeshin. The afro suits me. ♪

00:22:23.125 --> 00:22:25.875
♪ Maintenance is easy.
Just wash it once. ♪

00:22:25.875 --> 00:22:28.875
♪ It's fluffy on my head.
Women fall like flies... ♪

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.500
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:06.875
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.875 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.583 --> 00:24:00.792
When you think of a mountain in winter,

00:24:00.792 --> 00:24:02.542
you think of skiing, hot springs,
love blossoming on the slopes,

00:24:02.542 --> 00:24:03.708
being surprised in co-ed baths,

00:24:03.708 --> 00:24:05.708
and glimpsing through steam a
stark naked beauty being murdered.

00:24:05.708 --> 00:24:07.208
You think of such
exciting and thrilling situations!

00:24:07.208 --> 00:24:08.375
But you won't forgive us if we do

00:24:08.375 --> 00:24:09.958
such lukewarm plotlines
and it doesn't suit us.

00:24:09.958 --> 00:24:12.250
We aim for action-less violence,
and aspects of human drama at times.

00:24:12.250 --> 00:24:14.750
It's on a snowy mountain,
but it'll be a muggy storyline!

00:24:14.750 --> 00:24:16.083
The sounds of gunfire echo,
blizzards blow wildly,

00:24:16.083 --> 00:24:17.750
avalanches crash, and it'll
be sunny with a chance of hell.

00:24:17.750 --> 00:24:19.208
A story of survival unfolds!

00:24:19.208 --> 00:24:21.542
Next time, it's "The Cold is Winter!
Snowed Under Episode"!

00:24:21.542 --> 00:24:22.583
You bring your own
oxygen mask and ice axe

00:24:22.583 --> 00:24:24.083
and you meet around the
television and break up there too.

00:24:24.083 --> 00:24:25.250
Shame on you.

00:24:25.250 --> 00:24:26.750
Oh, and for all you fans
out there, thanks for waiting!

00:24:26.750 --> 00:24:28.594
Matsuya's showing up! Matsuya!
